    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\nURL and SEO configuration in BM drives organic search traffic and determines how Magento URL patterns are redirected. For Zimmermann's seven storefronts across multiple locales this is especially high-risk — wrong locale mappings or missing 301 redirects will cause SEO regression post-launch.\n\n**📎 Salesforce Reference:** [Validate Site URLs Configuration — Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/b2c-solution-functional-launch-readiness/b2c-review-business-manager)  \n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [SEO URL Rules in Business Manager](https://documentation.b2c.commercecloud.salesforce.com/DOC2/topic/com.demandware.dochelp/SEO/SEOU)  \n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [ShopperSEO API — URL Mapping](https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/commerce/commerce-api/references/shopper-seo)\n\n**⚠️ Risk note:** SEO URL configuration must be done before go-live — retroactively adding or correcting redirect mappings post-launch causes broken links and indexing gaps that take months to recover from.\n\n---\n\nChecklist\n---------\n\n### URL Rules (BM: Merchant Tools → SEO → URL Rules)\n\nincompleteURL rules are **enabled** on all sites\nincompleteBlank replacement character is set to `-` (minus) — not underscore\nincompleteCharacter replacement is **activated** and replacement rules configured\nincompleteLocale mapping rule set to a value other than `None` for all multi-locale sites\nincompleteURL conflicts are **resolved** — all conflicts documented before launch\n\n### Per-Site Alias Configuration\n\nincompleteAU — unique alias configured for staging and production instances\nincompleteUK — unique alias configured for staging and production instances\nincompleteUS Domestic — unique alias configured\nincompleteUS Intl — unique alias configured\nincompleteEU Domestic — unique alias configured\nincompleteEU Intl — unique alias configured\nincompleteME — unique alias configured\n\n### Magento → SFCC 301 Redirect Mapping\n\nincompleteFull Magento URL sitemap extracted and mapped to SFCC URL patterns\nincompleteStatic redirect mappings loaded into BM (Merchant Tools → SEO → Redirect URLs)\nincompleteDynamic URL mappings configured via ShopperSEO for product, category, and content URLs\nincompleteRedirect mapping tested — sample of high-traffic Magento URLs return 301 to correct SFCC URL\n\n### Locale Routing\n\nincompleteLocale path prefixes correct per site (e.g. `/en-AU/`, `/en-GB/`, `/fr-FR/`)\nincompleteLocale mapping rules active per site\nincompleteLocale switching on the storefront routes to the correct locale URL\n\n### Hreflang & Canonical\n\nincompleteHreflang tags are rendering correctly per locale per page type\nincompleteCanonical URLs are set correctly and not pointing to staging/sandbox URLs\nincomplete`robots.txt` is configured correctly — staging instances must disallow crawlers\n\n\n---\n\nNotes / Findings\n----------------\n\n*Record gaps, decisions, and owner for remediation here.*\n\n| Finding | Severity | Owner | Resolved |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  |  |  |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
